  The assistant role needs a session service, a recognition service and supportsAssist (AssistantRoleBehavior).
  Q6 (ANAL-220): an agent's read_screen and take_screenshot use the assist structure, with its screen content, and the
  assist screenshot. AOSP 17 removes those from a session unless the assistant declares them (and the person allows
  "Use text from screen", tools/ScreenConsentActivity.kt).
-->
<voice-interaction-service xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:sessionService="dev.openbook.quire.assist.QuireSessionService"
    android:recognitionService="dev.openbook.quire.assist.QuireRecognitionService"
    android:supportsAssist="true"
    android:supportsLaunchVoiceAssistFromKeyguard="false"
    android:supportsLocalInteraction="false"
    android:usesAssistData="true"
    android:usesAssistScreenshots="true"
    android:usesAssistStructureScreenContent="true" />
